    "description": "<p>Docker image built from the <a href=\"https://github.com/roboneurolibre/fmriprep-denoise-benchmark/commit/b568759fd2cbf9b27ef170a9c9984aaaf0de40a3\"> reference repository/commit by roboneuro</a>, based on the <a href=\"https://github.com/SIMEXP/fmriprep-denoise-benchmark/commit/02f2fa2a0b26b3624a9108e8d600ff4c64047d5c\">latest change by the author</a>, using repo2docker (through BinderHub).<br>\nTo run locally:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">docker load &lt; DockerImage_10.55458_NeuroLibre_00012_b56875.tar.gz</code></pre>\n\n\t<pre>&nbsp;</pre>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">docker run -it --rm -p 8888:8888 DOCKER_IMAGE_ID jupyter lab --ip 0.0.0.0</code></pre>\n\t<strong>by replacing <code>DOCKER_IMAGE_ID</code>&nbsp;above with the respective ID of the Docker image loaded from the tar.gz. file.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>For details, please visit the corresponding <a href=\"https://github.com/neurolibre/neurolibre-reviews/issues/12\">NeuroLibre technical screening.</a></p>\n\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://neurolibre.org\">https://neurolibre.org</a></strong></p>"
  },
